  "query": "For a healthcare-grade multi-tenant SaaS application in the healthcare sector (requiring compliance with HIPAA, GDPR), analyze the trade-offs between the authentication, authorization, and encryption models, grouped by category like\n        •        Authentication & Federation Protocols: OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect.\n        •        Token & Session Models: JWT.\n        •        Access Control Models: RBAC (Role-Based Access Control), ABAC (Attribute-Based Access Control).\n        •        Encryption & Data Protection: Attribute-Based Encryption (ABE).\n\nFor each model, provide a detailed technical comparison covering:\n        •        Security Strengths & Weaknesses (with real-world breach case studies).\n        •        Compliance Alignment (HIPAA, GDPR).\n        •        Performance Impact (latency, scalability in multi-tenant contexts).\n        •        Operational Complexity (deployment, maintenance, auditing).\n        •        Integration Considerations\n\nInclude a comparison table summarizing pros, cons, and best-fit scenarios for each model."
